[00:20.98][00:22.71][00:33.41][00:34.76]Oh, na-na-na
[00:24.17][00:36.26]Oh, na-da-da da-da-da da da
[00:28.11][00:40.24]La-da-da da da da-da
[00:31.35][00:43.55][01:59.58][01:59.58][01:59.58]
[00:49.09] Silent and lugubrious, I wander down the hall
[00:55.34] Time gets wasted here, I think I've lost it all
[01:01.19] You masqueraded as the one to save my soul
[01:05.97] But now I know
[01:08.68] A sublingual dose
[01:12.78] Sugary sweet like candy
[01:15.90] Rotting my teeth and memory
[01:18.54] Annihilating my purpose
[01:21.37] Now I've melted in your mouth
[01:24.96] Biting my tongue for answers
[01:27.96] Sucking that sweet for hours
[01:30.91] Fucking my head up proper
[01:33.44] Now my stomach hurts
[01:37.02][01:49.15][03:14.33][03:26.41] Oh gummyworm, oh gummyworm
[01:40.17][03:17.35] Oh gummyworm, do I make you squirm?
[01:43.91][03:21.00] I sent my soul somewhere far away
[01:52.38][03:29.54] Oh gummyworm, does the memory hurt?
[01:56.03][03:33.20] I lost my mind, now I'm in a daze
[02:26.79] (Ah, I forgot the words)
[02:28.15] As I stumble through the door
[02:32.46] Mind is racing still
[02:34.92]It leaves me wanting more
[02:38.42] You fogged my vision up, now everything's obscured
[02:43.18] You go to work
[02:46.01]My god, it hurts
[02:50.07] Absolute awful shithead
[02:53.09] Trusting the things that you said
[02:55.81] Eroding my sense of comfort
[02:58.50] I am falling faster now
[03:02.12] Saccharine, empty, fleeting
[03:05.29] Colorful words with no meaning
[03:08.26] Stuffing my face with sugar
[03:10.72] Crashing straight into the ground
[03:36.84]
